{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831720/extras/babc07b3b723876472d4e77ca9a7b98c.avif?t=1766167345\" width=780 height=100 /></span>Forge a thriving colony of economic might in an alternate history where the Roman Empire never fell, but lived on to discover the new world and harness steam technology. As a colonial governor on the brink of an early, industrial revolution, guide your colony\u2019s technological path, expand horizons in an uncharted land, and manage your burgeoning cities and resources within a fully simulated Roman Steampunk colony.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expand across a vast isometric map with aqueducts, horseless chariots, and rail. With evolving technologies from another timeline, develop and enhance intricate economic chains and trade to meet the needs of a growing population. Transform your colony into a network of thriving, opulent Roman cities and bring glory to the Empire!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831720/extras/181ae716cfde4669339aa2adbc994fe6.poster.avif?t=1766167345\" aria-label=\"A small set of towns shown with steam powered horseless carriages traveling between them\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831720/extras/181ae716cfde4669339aa2adbc994fe6.webm?t=1766167345\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831720/extras/181ae716cfde4669339aa2adbc994fe6.mp4?t=1766167345\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in an alternate history where steam-powered machines, intricate mechanical devices, and lavish Roman architecture coexist, in a society where peace and order has reigned for hundreds of years.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831720/extras/e85aa8caf7a7b881d22502cfeb10c92b.avif?t=1766167345\" width=780 height=100 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build and manage multiple cities while meeting the needs of different population classes. Adapt to dynamic borders and autonomous population growth in a living, breathing simulated world. Construct aqueducts for fresh water, develop rail and road networks for trade, and expand your infrastructure with purpose.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831720/extras/5a0c63d3e8e41db7929149893fabeaec.avif?t=1766167345\" width=780 height=100 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831720/extras/fd03dc11c7f761b09c2b21a98b9a47d3.poster.avif?t=1766167345\" aria-label=\"Resources shown moving from production to storage\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831720/extras/fd03dc11c7f761b09c2b21a98b9a47d3.webm?t=1766167345\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831720/extras/fd03dc11c7f761b09c2b21a98b9a47d3.mp4?t=1766167345\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Produce and transport goods through layered production chains\u2014fish, flour, cigars, and more\u2014each serving specific population classes. Establish automated trade routes using steam-powered vehicles, trains, and airships. Optimize your economy through efficient planning and logistics.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831720/extras/3c3bd508abeb9a364375ec86041ca781.avif?t=1766167345\" width=780 height=100 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831720/extras/97f6efdc674e29b6203feb6893cc3946.poster.avif?t=1766167345\" aria-label=\"Camera pans over a procedurally generated isometric world. Each game is different.\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831720/extras/97f6efdc674e29b6203feb6893cc3946.webm?t=1766167345\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831720/extras/97f6efdc674e29b6203feb6893cc3946.mp4?t=1766167345\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every map is unique, procedurally generated with diverse biomes\u2014forests, beaches, rivers, mountains\u2014and resource placements. Adapt your strategy to the terrain while navigating fresh water access, construction constraints, and optimal city placement.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831720/extras/fd34fdf480d38f1f0ea1453e2289d1a3.poster.avif?t=1766167345\" aria-label=\"This offers a view of different lenses in the game that show availability of resources\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831720/extras/fd34fdf480d38f1f0ea1453e2289d1a3.webm?t=1766167345\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831720/extras/fd34fdf480d38f1f0ea1453e2289d1a3.mp4?t=1766167345\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831720/extras/c4607b3a7b85f64859e4d51e11dc2e6c.avif?t=1766167345\" width=780 height=100 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shape your colony\u2019s destiny through a branching tech tree born from an unknown steam-fueled industrial revolution of antiquity. With every decision, unlock powerful synergies with game-changing upgrades and abilities from an unknown alternate timeline.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831720/extras/5569ac59b82b2777af4867ebb6ea2c8c.avif?t=1766167345\" width=780 height=100 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose specific goals at the start of each playthrough\u2014completing them unlocks powerful perks for future games. These perks reshape how you play, opening up new strategies and synergies. Discover the right combinations to tackle fresh challenges and unlock them all!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831720/extras/c8391612590fb6f25a169541847b331f.avif?t=1766167345\" width=780 height=100 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831720/extras/227303e04ee686f493d80f3b72a3bbf0.poster.avif?t=1766167345\" aria-label=\"Seasons are shown changing as the foliage changes color\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831720/extras/227303e04ee686f493d80f3b72a3bbf0.webm?t=1766167345\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831720/extras/227303e04ee686f493d80f3b72a3bbf0.mp4?t=1766167345\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Time progresses through a 13-month calendar featuring the Roman-invented &quot;Constinius&quot; month. Visual time tracking enhances gameplay clarity and progression.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >An Optimistic Vision</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nova Patria is a Roman Steampunk Colony Sim. In this alternate history, the empire never fell and lived on to discover the New World and steam power. Manage your colony\u2019s intricate supply chains, expanding cities, and innovations in a hopeful, procedurally generated, isometric simulation of industrial antiquity.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3831720?t=1766167345","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831720/ff1bfb4bdd45c0c2e648ca3a7dc6a54654fca1b1/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1766167345","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831720/93c9136a991b6fa33db56599c715771e9372b545/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1766167345","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831720/93c9136a991b6fa33db56599c715771e9372b545/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1766167345","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":4054930,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831720/extras/babc07b3b723876472d4e77ca9a7b98c.avif?t=1766167345\" width=780 height=100 /></span>Forge a thriving colony of economic might in an alternate history where the Roman Empire never fell, but lived on to discover the new world and harnes