tem_assets/steam/apps/3831720/extras/97f6efdc674e29b6203feb6893cc3946.poster.avif?t=1766167345\" aria-label=\"Camera pans over a procedurally generated isometric world. Each game is different.\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831720/extras/97f6efdc674e29b6203feb6893cc3946.webm?t=1766167345\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831720/extras/97f6efdc674e29b6203feb6893cc3946.mp4?t=1766167345\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every map is unique, procedurally generated with diverse biomes\u2014forests, beaches, rivers, mountains\u2014and resource placements. Adapt your strategy to the terrain while navigating fresh water access, construction constraints, and optimal city placement.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831720/extras/fd34fdf480d38f1f0ea1453e2289d1a3.poster.avif?t=1766167345\" aria-label=\"This offers a view of different lenses in the game that show availability of resources\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831720/extras/fd34fdf480d38f1f0ea1453e2289d1a3.webm?t=1766167345\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831720/extras/fd34fdf480d38f1f0ea1453e2289d1a3.mp4?t=1766167345\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831720/extras/c4607b3a7b85f64859e4d51e11dc2e6c.avif?t=1766167345\" width=780 height=100 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shape your colony\u2019s destiny through a branching tech tree born from an unknown steam-fueled industrial revolution of antiquity. With every decision, unlock powerful synergies with game-changing upgrades and abilities from an unknown alternate timeline.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831720/extras/5569ac59b82b2777af4867ebb6ea2c8c.avif?t=1766167345\" width=780 height=100 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose specific goals at the start of each playthrough\u2014completing them unlocks powerful perks for future games. These perks reshape how you play, opening up new strategies and synergies. Discover the right combinations to tackle fresh challenges and unlock them all!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831720/extras/c8391612590fb6f25a169541847b331f.avif?t=1766167345\" width=780 height=100 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831720/extras/227303e04ee686f493d80f3b72a3bbf0.poster.avif?t=1766167345\" aria-label=\"Seasons are shown changing as the foliage changes color\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831720/extras/227303e04ee686f493d80f3b72a3bbf0.webm?t=1766167345\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831720/extras/227303e04ee686f493d80f3b72a3bbf0.mp4?t=1766167345\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Time progresses through a 13-month calendar featuring the Roman-invented &quot;Constinius&quot; month. Visual time tracking enhances gameplay clarity and progression.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >An Optimistic Vision</h2><p class=\"bb_paragra